WEBVTT

01:40.840 --> 01:44.180
[A Moment But Forever]

01:44.990 --> 01:47.210
[Episode 21]

01:47.860 --> 01:48.350
No.

01:49.070 --> 01:50.200
He wants to go to Su River.

01:50.920 --> 01:51.710
Su River?

01:52.759 --> 01:54.070
That place is remote.

01:54.120 --> 01:56.039
It's far away and sparsely populated.

01:56.070 --> 01:57.400
Why would he want to go there?

01:57.710 --> 01:58.509
Yes.

01:58.789 --> 02:00.120
I just want to go to Su River

02:00.120 --> 02:01.150
and get Ling Yao out.

02:01.230 --> 02:01.950
No way.

02:02.400 --> 02:03.760
I want to go to Su River to pick Ling Yao up, too.

02:05.230 --> 02:06.680
Is Ling Yao a woman?

02:08.870 --> 02:10.310
She's a beautiful woman.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.240
Stop arguing, all of you.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.520
I'll accompany them to Yandu.

02:19.079 --> 02:19.870
Let's draw lots.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.310
One draw to decide.

02:22.630 --> 02:23.470
Yuanzhong.

02:24.000 --> 02:24.840
Lu Chen has already agreed

02:24.840 --> 02:25.560
to go with you.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.870
Why draw lots?

02:26.910 --> 02:28.000
That's right. Lu Chen has already...

02:28.000 --> 02:30.120
Enough talk. The one who draws the smallest number, come with me.

02:38.030 --> 02:39.560
Looks like I'm going to Su River.

02:41.470 --> 02:42.470
Zi Fei's got the smallest number.

03:00.360 --> 03:02.080
I heard Yandu has nice scenery.

03:04.630 --> 03:05.590
I've heard about it.

03:05.680 --> 03:07.080
It's a pity that no matter how beautiful the scenery is,

03:07.680 --> 03:09.310
we won't be able to enjoy it for long.

03:13.360 --> 03:15.240
After we find Xiu and Ling Yao,

03:15.920 --> 03:17.320
the five weapon spirits will be gathered,

03:17.630 --> 03:18.400
and then, you'll be able to borrow

03:18.400 --> 03:20.000
the power of the Divine Left Hand

03:20.190 --> 03:21.750
to summon Heavenly Fire to descend upon the world

03:22.240 --> 03:24.190
and destroy all sins in the world.

03:32.710 --> 03:33.870
Is this why

03:34.400 --> 03:35.150
you didn't read the letter

03:35.150 --> 03:36.240
Pei Jiu left you?

03:38.120 --> 03:39.000
I gave up Yunniang

03:39.000 --> 03:40.360
because I'm still clear-headed.

03:45.750 --> 03:46.560
What about you?

03:47.680 --> 03:48.640
Are you still clear-headed?

04:36.040 --> 04:37.270
Shouldn't we share some with Zi Fei?

04:38.310 --> 04:39.560
Since he can't go see Ling Yao,

04:39.800 --> 04:40.720
he's in a bad mood.

04:41.000 --> 04:41.870
Don't worry about him.

04:41.900 --> 04:42.830
What kind of woman

04:42.830 --> 04:44.000
is Ling Yao exactly,

04:44.190 --> 04:46.000
that Zi Fei is so obsessed with her?

04:46.720 --> 04:47.600
Ling Yao is of the water element,

04:47.920 --> 04:48.920
graceful and elegant,

04:49.040 --> 04:50.120
gentle and charming.

04:50.800 --> 04:52.190
Among all my weapon spirits,

04:52.210 --> 04:53.240
she's the most obedient.

04:53.510 --> 04:55.070
Then I believe this trip with Kai Shan and Lu Chen

04:55.070 --> 04:56.480
will go very smoothly.

04:58.240 --> 04:59.600
They'll indeed have a smooth journey,

04:59.870 --> 05:02.160
but it might not be the same for us.

05:02.250 --> 05:03.130
Why is that?

05:04.560 --> 05:05.830
My last weapon spirit

05:05.830 --> 05:06.720
is called Xiu.

05:07.000 --> 05:07.870
It's of the fire element.

05:08.240 --> 05:09.480
Its temper is a bit peculiar.

05:09.630 --> 05:10.950
It's easy to find it,

05:11.160 --> 05:12.040
but subduing it

05:12.510 --> 05:13.750
will be quite difficult.

05:14.560 --> 05:16.000
Is it also a woman?

05:17.310 --> 05:18.680
You'll know when you meet it.

05:59.380 --> 06:00.650
Tanghua, you're awake.

06:04.920 --> 06:05.720
Someone, come quickly!

06:08.430 --> 06:09.630
Come here and look after him.

06:10.000 --> 06:10.800
Yes.

06:13.870 --> 06:14.680
Excuse me.

06:16.560 --> 06:17.360
Water.

06:18.270 --> 06:18.950
Okay.

06:35.480 --> 06:36.270
Thank you.

06:41.390 --> 06:42.560
Where is this place?

06:42.720 --> 06:43.750
In response to your question, Sir,

06:43.920 --> 06:45.800
this is the City Lord's Mansion in Yandu City.

06:46.000 --> 06:47.270
You're in our young mistress's boudoir.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.070
You got injured,

06:49.240 --> 06:50.800
and our young mistress brought you back.

06:50.800 --> 06:51.950
It's been a few days.

06:52.830 --> 06:53.630
Bou-

06:54.830 --> 06:55.680
Boudoir?

06:56.240 --> 06:57.040
Yes.

07:08.390 --> 07:09.480
Young... Young Mistress.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.000
Young Mistress, please slow down.

07:11.070 --> 07:12.000
These old bones of mine

07:12.000 --> 07:13.000
-can't keep up with you.
-Hurry up.

07:13.000 --> 07:13.870
Young Mistress. Young Mistress.

07:13.870 --> 07:14.630
Come, this way please.

07:14.630 --> 07:15.750
Slowly, slowly.

07:15.770 --> 07:16.570
Young Mistress.

07:19.630 --> 07:20.800
You mustn't sit.

07:20.800 --> 07:21.920
You mustn't.

07:22.560 --> 07:23.360
Come on.

07:23.430 --> 07:24.240
Come on.

07:24.270 --> 07:24.940
Lie down.

07:33.070 --> 07:34.780
Doctor, how is he?

07:36.390 --> 07:38.270
His pulse is sluggish and rough,

07:38.270 --> 07:40.190
weak and insufficient,

07:40.950 --> 07:42.430
indicating a condition of exhaustion.

07:43.010 --> 07:45.130
He has chest tightness and shortness of breath,

07:45.480 --> 07:46.920
which is due to the body's defense energy fighting against pathogens,

07:47.750 --> 07:49.560
caused by insufficient yang energy.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.070
Additionally, his muscles and bones

07:51.870 --> 07:53.630
were severely injured the other day,

07:53.750 --> 07:55.630
and his spleen was also damaged.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.510
It's truly a fundamental injury.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.630
You said the same thing last time.

08:01.160 --> 08:03.190
Is he getting better or not?

08:05.830 --> 08:07.430
Don't be anxious, Young Mistress.

08:08.640 --> 08:10.190
With injuries like these,

08:10.430 --> 08:11.950
if he were one of us humans,

08:11.970 --> 08:14.000
he would have died long ago.

08:14.750 --> 08:18.720
But Sir here is an immortal of the Youhu Clan.

08:19.080 --> 08:21.270
He only needs to rest for half a month...

08:22.200 --> 08:23.200
I mean, three to five months...

08:23.220 --> 08:24.540
No, a year or so.

08:24.570 --> 08:27.410
He can fully recover in a year or so.

08:27.750 --> 08:28.750
Dr. Zhang.

08:28.800 --> 08:30.440
You're a renowned physician, aren't you?

08:31.950 --> 08:33.750
How can your diagnosis be so vague?

08:34.150 --> 08:35.240
How long will it actually take?

08:37.120 --> 08:37.909
I...

08:39.360 --> 08:40.720
This is also my first time

08:40.720 --> 08:43.150
taking the pulse of a Youhu immortal.

08:43.240 --> 08:44.000
In this old man's opinion,

08:44.000 --> 08:45.480
he should have died long ago.

08:46.550 --> 08:47.320
But, but...

08:47.320 --> 08:49.390
He's still alive now, isn't he?

08:49.390 --> 08:52.550
If you ask me how many days it will take

08:52.550 --> 08:53.840
for him to fully recover,

08:53.990 --> 08:55.990
I really have no idea.

08:56.660 --> 08:58.300
Young Mistress. Sir.

08:58.750 --> 08:59.870
This old man takes his leave.

09:10.390 --> 09:11.200
Thanks a lot.

09:12.360 --> 09:15.000
I should be the one thanking you.

09:15.910 --> 09:17.750
You got injured while saving me.

09:26.840 --> 09:27.630
Dai.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.750
Mr. Tanghua.

09:31.720 --> 09:33.440
This is my younger brother, Zhi Yue.

09:35.710 --> 09:36.990
Sir, there's no need for formalities.

09:40.220 --> 09:41.580
Young City Lord Zhi Yue.

09:41.750 --> 09:42.790
Thank you for your rescue.

09:43.600 --> 09:45.200
I, Tanghua, am deeply grateful.

09:45.790 --> 09:47.120
Sir, you're too kind.

09:47.440 --> 09:49.200
Our two races have always been on good terms.

09:49.200 --> 09:50.550
Besides, you're Dai's friend,

09:50.790 --> 09:52.080
which makes you a friend of our Yandu.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.790
Friends helping each other

09:53.790 --> 09:54.870
is only natural.

09:56.390 --> 09:57.750
Sir, you needn't worry.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.630
Just focus on recovering here

09:59.750 --> 10:01.600
and make sure to heal properly.

10:03.510 --> 10:04.320
Thank you.

10:05.440 --> 10:07.290
Then I won't disturb your rest, Sir.

10:07.430 --> 10:08.310
If there's anything you need,

10:08.550 --> 10:09.550
please don't hesitate to ask.

10:10.360 --> 10:11.320
I'll take my leave now.

10:31.030 --> 10:31.840
What's wrong?

10:35.030 --> 10:36.910
Nothing. I'm just curious.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.510
I often hear Father talk about

10:38.670 --> 10:39.960
how you were away from home for years because of

10:39.960 --> 10:40.960
this person, Dai.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.580
Now I've finally met him.

10:43.670 --> 10:45.270
He's indeed outstanding.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.870
You have good taste, Dai.

10:47.150 --> 10:48.360
It's all in the past now.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.480
It's all in the past?

10:54.080 --> 10:54.870
Well, never mind.

10:55.910 --> 10:57.120
When will Father come out of seclusion?

10:57.750 --> 10:59.150
I'm not sure about that either.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.030
The immortal medicine you brought back this time

11:01.030 --> 11:02.030
is extraordinary, Dai.

11:02.150 --> 11:03.670
It might still take some time

11:03.670 --> 11:04.670
to absorb its properties.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.120
But when the ending draws near,

11:06.120 --> 11:07.200
we'll be notified.

11:07.590 --> 11:09.070
Dai, you need to rest more.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.870
You've visibly lost weight these past few days.

11:11.240 --> 11:12.030
You too.

11:14.150 --> 11:15.480
Well then, Dai, I'll head back now.

11:15.480 --> 11:16.440
No need to see me out.

11:16.240 --> 11:23.730
[Ningrui Pavilion]

12:09.550 --> 12:10.640
It's all in the past.

12:33.270 --> 12:34.080
Chief.

12:34.250 --> 12:35.430
We've been on the road for too long.

12:35.840 --> 12:37.200
Everyone is almost at their limit.

12:37.510 --> 12:38.360
How about we find a place

12:38.360 --> 12:39.150
to rest and recuperate?

12:39.670 --> 12:41.510
There's a water source 10 miles to the east.

12:41.720 --> 12:42.840
Let's go rest there.

12:43.320 --> 12:43.960
Yes.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.150
Why are you staring at me?

13:07.480 --> 13:08.240
Since you found out

13:08.240 --> 13:09.630
I'm the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain,

13:09.630 --> 13:11.080
you've always wanted to drive me away.

13:11.660 --> 13:12.900
Why don't you want to drive me away now?

13:13.530 --> 13:15.170
You saved me again in my sea of consciousness.

13:15.870 --> 13:17.480
How could I have the heart to drive you away now?

13:19.270 --> 13:20.870
But I'd saved you before that, too.

13:21.890 --> 13:22.720
Then leave.

13:23.200 --> 13:24.150
I'm driving you away.

13:32.750 --> 13:33.960
I want to ask you a question.

13:37.880 --> 13:39.910
Earlier, in your sea of consciousness,

13:39.910 --> 13:40.960
I saw myself.

13:41.360 --> 13:42.200
You pictured me as

13:42.200 --> 13:43.510
a witch,

13:43.720 --> 13:45.530
foolishly guarding the door for you.

13:46.030 --> 13:47.240
That demon said

13:47.600 --> 13:49.390
this means you both guard against me

13:49.390 --> 13:50.600
and trust me.

13:51.600 --> 13:52.720
So, do you really guard against me

13:52.720 --> 13:53.960
or trust me?

13:58.910 --> 13:59.720
Also,

14:00.390 --> 14:01.480
your dreams

14:02.320 --> 14:03.870
get scarier with each layer.

14:05.510 --> 14:06.750
So what's in your ninth layer

14:06.750 --> 14:07.600
of dreams?

14:07.870 --> 14:08.670
Ji Tanyin.

14:10.480 --> 14:11.320
Why does the War Demon

14:11.320 --> 14:12.630
have your birth date and time

14:12.920 --> 14:14.200
and is able to possess you?

14:16.280 --> 14:17.710
I... I don't know either.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.000
Then are you willing to let me enter

14:19.000 --> 14:20.150
your sea of consciousness?

14:20.600 --> 14:21.510
In other words,

14:22.080 --> 14:23.030
are you willing to let me know

14:23.030 --> 14:24.510
the secrets in your heart?

14:30.100 --> 14:31.430
Since you're not willing yourself,

14:32.240 --> 14:33.080
what right do you have

14:33.080 --> 14:34.600
to know everything about me?

14:38.270 --> 14:39.270
Let me give you a piece of advice.

14:40.000 --> 14:40.910
Don't try to know

14:40.910 --> 14:42.440
everything about anyone.

14:43.160 --> 14:44.310
You'll be disappointed.

15:31.910 --> 15:32.690
Chief.

15:33.720 --> 15:35.770
I have a question to ask.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.550
I don't understand.

15:41.480 --> 15:43.480
I saw it clearly at that time,

15:44.790 --> 15:45.960
Chief, that you clearly had the chance

15:45.960 --> 15:47.840
to plunge the dagger into his heart,

15:48.840 --> 15:50.150
but you held back.

15:52.600 --> 15:54.600
Because I saw his eyes.

15:56.040 --> 15:57.560
Those were the eyes of a demon.

15:58.380 --> 15:59.490
The eyes of a demon?

16:00.790 --> 16:01.750
How is that possible?

16:02.150 --> 16:03.120
It's impossible indeed.

16:03.720 --> 16:05.480
He is the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

16:05.550 --> 16:07.270
and he possesses the Divine Left Hand.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.510
Why would he have the eyes of a demon?

16:33.000 --> 16:33.790
Where are you going?

16:33.910 --> 16:34.840
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

16:34.880 --> 16:35.670
Come with me.

16:35.880 --> 16:36.670
Let go of me!

16:37.080 --> 16:38.240
My mother is still in Gushan.

16:38.480 --> 16:39.630
I need to go back and find her.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.840
You won't find her.

16:40.840 --> 16:41.550
I can!

16:42.390 --> 16:43.550
Can't you just listen to me?

16:43.910 --> 16:44.730
I won't!

16:44.760 --> 16:45.410
You-

16:54.480 --> 16:55.270
Chief.

17:00.880 --> 17:02.400
How old is your mother?

17:05.380 --> 17:06.339
Don't you know?

17:07.589 --> 17:09.000
She must not be young anymore.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.710
Ming Zhang was right.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.200
You won't find her.

17:12.480 --> 17:13.270
Why?

17:13.440 --> 17:14.569
She's already dead.

17:14.670 --> 17:15.560
That's impossible!

17:17.220 --> 17:18.910
Our clan has the blood of the divine race.

17:19.069 --> 17:20.109
We have long lifespans.

17:20.270 --> 17:21.440
How could she have died?

17:21.880 --> 17:23.200
According to our clan's rules,

17:23.750 --> 17:25.109
men protect the clan and kill enemies

17:25.109 --> 17:26.240
until their last breath,

17:26.640 --> 17:27.849
while women bear offspring

17:27.880 --> 17:29.160
also until their last breath.

17:29.550 --> 17:31.510
Our clan's constitution is different from that of the human race.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.400
Childbirth damages the mother's body

17:33.400 --> 17:34.680
and drains a lot of vital energy.

17:34.680 --> 17:35.640
That's why in our War Demon Clan,

17:35.640 --> 17:37.030
no woman can live long.

17:37.030 --> 17:37.830
Nonsense!

17:39.000 --> 17:40.030
That's not true.

17:41.270 --> 17:42.790
Don't you know in your heart

17:42.920 --> 17:44.640
whether what I said is true or not?

17:45.110 --> 17:46.960
You grew up in the War Demon Clan.

17:47.160 --> 17:48.920
How many elderly women have you seen?

17:49.480 --> 17:50.750
After the Battle of Pinghu,

17:51.110 --> 17:53.160
only about one out of 100 of our War Demon Clan survived.

17:53.720 --> 17:54.750
In extraordinary times,

17:54.750 --> 17:56.240
extraordinary measures must be taken.

17:56.920 --> 17:57.830
If not for this,

17:58.000 --> 17:59.790
how could our clan have survived until now?

17:59.790 --> 18:01.270
How could we have accumulated enough strength

18:01.270 --> 18:02.480
to fight against our enemies?

18:02.920 --> 18:03.830
Why?

18:05.510 --> 18:07.640
The human race was once enslaved too,

18:07.640 --> 18:09.160
and they also once became a vassal of another clan.

18:09.160 --> 18:10.720
Why didn't they do this?

18:11.750 --> 18:13.160
That's because they are weak.

18:13.270 --> 18:14.790
They are used to bowing and scraping,

18:14.790 --> 18:16.750
living by begging for mercy.

18:17.510 --> 18:18.960
They are unwilling to make changes

18:18.960 --> 18:20.350
and unwilling to make sacrifices.

18:20.860 --> 18:21.660
Therefore,

18:21.880 --> 18:23.920
they are destined to always be the weak ones!

18:24.560 --> 18:25.880
You speak so grandly,

18:26.830 --> 18:28.440
but you're a woman too.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.440
Why don't you go die?

18:30.460 --> 18:31.250
I will.

18:32.430 --> 18:34.480
As long as I can create the perfect War Demon,

18:34.550 --> 18:35.680
revive our clan,

18:35.680 --> 18:37.310
and kill the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

18:38.240 --> 18:40.000
I'm ready to die at any moment.

18:40.440 --> 18:42.350
I'll send you on your way right now!

18:47.720 --> 18:48.510
Stop!

18:54.640 --> 18:55.440
Ming Zhang!

19:12.780 --> 19:15.190
You cost me a great warrior.

19:18.370 --> 19:19.160
Chief...

19:19.680 --> 19:20.890
Chief, I beg you.

19:22.030 --> 19:23.790
Please spare his life.

19:25.860 --> 19:27.300
He just wants to reunite with his mother.

19:28.510 --> 19:29.510
There's nothing wrong with that.

19:29.970 --> 19:31.010
The one who deserves to die

19:31.700 --> 19:33.700
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

19:34.270 --> 19:35.200
not him.

19:36.380 --> 19:37.170
Chief.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.480
I've shattered your source of power

20:02.880 --> 20:04.480
and destroyed all your skills.

20:04.830 --> 20:05.920
From now on,

20:06.160 --> 20:08.030
you are no longer a member of the War Demon Clan.

20:47.310 --> 20:48.110
Ming Zhang.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.000
Ming Zhang.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.750
Ming... Ming Zhang!

20:57.070 --> 20:57.880
Ming Zhang!

20:58.960 --> 20:59.750
Ming Zhang!

21:00.270 --> 21:01.110
How are you?

21:03.070 --> 21:03.790
I know.

21:03.790 --> 21:05.110
I... I'll find someone to save you.

21:05.110 --> 21:06.240
I know someone who can save you.

21:06.240 --> 21:07.750
I... I'll go find someone to save you.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.440
No need.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.310
What?

21:13.640 --> 21:14.440
I...

21:16.490 --> 21:17.490
Am finally...

21:20.000 --> 21:21.130
Relieved...

21:23.830 --> 21:27.480
No, no. You...

21:27.750 --> 21:29.920
Ming Zhang! Ming Zhang!

21:32.880 --> 21:34.550
Why did you help me?

21:34.880 --> 21:35.960
Why?

21:36.510 --> 21:38.400
You've been helping me since the first time we met.

21:38.480 --> 21:39.750
Why?

21:40.920 --> 21:41.790
Because...

21:43.400 --> 21:45.070
Because I am also...

21:46.790 --> 21:48.270
Mother's son.

21:51.760 --> 21:53.200
I am Mother's...

21:54.750 --> 21:56.510
First son.

22:06.110 --> 22:06.920
Lin.

22:07.510 --> 22:09.070
Look, what's this?

22:09.590 --> 22:11.590
Mother, how come there's still food?

22:13.960 --> 22:14.920
Eat slowly, okay?

22:20.030 --> 22:20.830
You...

22:23.480 --> 22:24.720
You're better than me.

22:26.350 --> 22:28.030
You must live well.

22:29.350 --> 22:30.200
As for me...

22:32.000 --> 22:34.000
I'll go find Mother first.

22:38.170 --> 22:39.310
Ming... Ming Zhang!

22:39.480 --> 22:40.510
Ming Zhang! Ming Zhang! Ming Zhang!

22:41.510 --> 22:42.310
Brother!

22:42.830 --> 22:43.640
Brother!

22:46.550 --> 22:47.350
Brother!

23:08.550 --> 23:10.200
[Yandu City]

23:19.920 --> 23:20.720
What's wrong?

23:23.160 --> 23:23.960
Nothing.

23:24.110 --> 23:25.310
Has Zi Fei arrived yet?

23:27.550 --> 23:28.350
No.

23:29.200 --> 23:30.750
Didn't you say he set off first?

23:41.000 --> 23:42.720
Yuanzhong, I've figured it out.

23:42.790 --> 23:43.720
During the drawing of lots earlier today,

23:43.720 --> 23:45.000
you must have cheated with magic.

23:45.000 --> 23:45.750
It doesn't count.

23:45.920 --> 23:47.510
I'm setting off to find Ling Yao now.

23:47.720 --> 23:48.550
Since it's a long journey,

23:48.550 --> 23:49.590
I'm taking the horse.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.880
Thank you. Don't worry about me.

23:51.160 --> 23:51.960
From Zi Fei.

24:03.200 --> 24:05.070
Yandu City is quite prosperous.

24:06.390 --> 24:08.220
It hasn't changed much though.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.830
You seem to know Yandu well.

24:15.680 --> 24:16.640
I've been here once.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.550
When?

24:18.680 --> 24:19.850
A long time ago.

24:21.090 --> 24:22.570
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

24:24.660 --> 24:26.290
I didn't know this place was called Yandu.

24:26.340 --> 24:28.490
I just suddenly remembered.

24:34.310 --> 24:35.310
Let's go in.

25:00.240 --> 25:02.560
Bravo! Bravo!

25:05.880 --> 25:08.720
Tang's live chickens, freshly slaughtered!

25:08.880 --> 25:10.640
Come check it out!

25:10.640 --> 25:12.830
Tang's live chickens, freshly slaughtered!

25:18.790 --> 25:19.590
Come again.

25:20.550 --> 25:21.240
Miss.

25:21.360 --> 25:22.840
Check out our newly arrived hairpins.

25:22.860 --> 25:24.170
Each one is more beautiful than the last.

25:24.410 --> 25:25.410
Which one do you like, Miss?

25:25.480 --> 25:26.510
I'll show you.

25:26.880 --> 25:29.030
Miss, how about this one?

25:29.030 --> 25:30.200
This is the best-selling hairpin

25:30.200 --> 25:31.680
at my little stall.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.430
Its shape

25:32.430 --> 25:33.720
resembles two intertwined branches,

25:33.720 --> 25:34.550
entwined together.

25:34.550 --> 25:36.030
It symbolizes a lifelong commitment,

25:36.030 --> 25:37.480
sharing both joys and sorrows.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.000
Do you like it?

25:40.070 --> 25:40.790
Miss.

25:40.790 --> 25:42.510
This intertwined-branch hairpin has a special meaning.

25:42.510 --> 25:44.110
It can only be given by a husband to his wife.

25:44.110 --> 25:44.680
After all,

25:44.680 --> 25:46.200
the intertwined branches and conjoined lotus

25:46.200 --> 25:47.270
are both tokens of love.

25:47.270 --> 25:49.400
It signifies lifelong companionship.

25:49.950 --> 25:51.430
We'll take this one.

25:51.720 --> 25:52.510
How much is it?

25:52.670 --> 25:54.030
Only 10 taels of silver.

25:54.060 --> 25:55.430
Absolutely a fair price.

25:55.640 --> 25:57.070
Boss, how much is this one?

25:57.590 --> 25:59.160
This one? This one is pure jade.

25:59.160 --> 26:00.070
Made of pure jade.

26:00.440 --> 26:01.400
It might be a bit expensive.

26:02.960 --> 26:03.750
Look.

26:05.790 --> 26:07.480
Here you go, Boss.

26:08.400 --> 26:09.830
Thank you, Sir. Here you go.

26:11.030 --> 26:11.830
Here.

26:13.470 --> 26:14.990
Worn by this young lady,

26:15.070 --> 26:16.160
the hairpin looks even more beautiful.

26:17.880 --> 26:18.680
Let's go.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.550
Take care, esteemed customers.

26:20.550 --> 26:21.350
Thank you.

26:26.960 --> 26:28.400
Stop! Someone come here!

26:28.400 --> 26:29.240
Those two cultivators

26:29.240 --> 26:30.160
used magic tricks to deceive people!

26:30.160 --> 26:31.240
-Let's go.
-Get them!

26:32.830 --> 26:34.310
There are swindlers! Quickly, report to the authorities!

26:32.950 --> 26:35.660
[Rest Teahouse]

26:34.310 --> 26:34.830
Got it!

26:34.830 --> 26:36.160
Stop! Stop!

26:36.250 --> 26:37.290
Catch the thieves!

26:37.550 --> 26:38.590
Catch the thieves!

26:38.830 --> 26:39.880
Catch the thieves!

26:40.830 --> 26:42.000
Catch the thieves! Catch the thieves!

26:43.590 --> 26:44.790
Catch them! Catch the thieves!

26:51.460 --> 26:52.630
Catch the thieves! Catch the thieves!

26:54.210 --> 26:55.290
Catch them! Catch the thieves!

26:55.320 --> 26:56.930
Don't you have a lot of money?

26:57.610 --> 26:58.850
Zi Fei took it all.

27:00.920 --> 27:02.480
This shopkeeper is probably a cultivator.

27:02.790 --> 27:03.480
Otherwise, he wouldn't

27:03.480 --> 27:04.680
have seen through my illusion.

27:06.790 --> 27:08.000
Make way, make way!

27:08.020 --> 27:08.830
Make way!

27:11.220 --> 27:13.220
Who are these two people?

27:13.940 --> 27:15.010
He seems to be that...

27:15.070 --> 27:15.790
What did they do?

27:15.810 --> 27:17.260
The one who just ran out.

27:16.920 --> 27:20.940
[Wanted] [Reward]

27:17.320 --> 27:18.360
The two thieves they were shouting about catching.

27:18.390 --> 27:19.780
What times are we living in?

27:19.830 --> 27:21.310
The Kunlun Mirror has been updated over a dozen times,

27:21.310 --> 27:22.480
and yet there are still cultivators

27:22.480 --> 27:24.270
using alchemy to turn stones into silver for fraud.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.920
They must have been cooped up for a long time.

27:25.920 --> 27:27.070
They don't know how the outside world

27:27.070 --> 27:28.440
has completely changed.

27:28.440 --> 27:29.400
They must think knowing some magic skills

27:29.400 --> 27:30.790
makes them invincible in this world.

27:31.030 --> 27:32.960
A-Aren't they idiots?

27:33.270 --> 27:34.160
Indeed.

27:35.880 --> 27:36.680
Let's go.

27:43.270 --> 27:44.240
Let me tell you something.

27:44.830 --> 27:46.200
I think I've figured it out.

27:46.350 --> 27:47.750
They must have used some kind of

27:47.880 --> 27:49.510
crafted device that separates truth from illusion.

27:49.550 --> 27:51.030
That's why they easily saw through

27:51.030 --> 27:51.880
your magic.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.640
So what do we do now?

27:56.590 --> 27:57.440
What do you mean?

27:57.880 --> 27:58.720
You don't have any money,

27:58.830 --> 27:59.720
and neither do I.

27:59.830 --> 28:01.270
We can't even afford to stay at an inn.

28:01.960 --> 28:02.750
Moreover,

28:03.030 --> 28:03.830
this thing

28:04.070 --> 28:05.750
is available even at small street stalls.

28:05.880 --> 28:06.750
So your magic skills

28:06.750 --> 28:07.920
are completely useless.

28:12.880 --> 28:13.790
Where's your money?

28:14.750 --> 28:15.790
Zi Fei took it.

28:23.270 --> 28:24.070
What's this?

28:24.590 --> 28:25.400
Liujiao Palace?

28:25.590 --> 28:26.750
Back at Baitou Mountain,

28:27.030 --> 28:27.790
this was the last assignment

28:27.790 --> 28:29.440
my master left for me.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.750
Before Zi Fei returns,

28:30.750 --> 28:32.110
we can stay here.

28:32.350 --> 28:33.160
Stay here?

28:50.240 --> 28:51.440
You've shrunk us.

28:52.310 --> 28:53.790
It's the space of this world

28:53.790 --> 28:55.160
that I've folded and compressed.

28:55.160 --> 28:55.920
All people and objects

28:55.920 --> 28:57.200
that can enter this world

28:57.200 --> 28:58.510
will change accordingly.

28:59.310 --> 29:00.440
How did we get in here?

29:00.640 --> 29:02.270
At the moment we entered,

29:02.480 --> 29:04.110
the space here was expanded.

29:04.200 --> 29:05.830
That's why you didn't feel anything.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.310
This place looks exactly like Liujiao Palace.

29:08.790 --> 29:10.640
I modeled it after Liujiao Palace.

29:22.310 --> 29:23.110
There's even wine.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.480
Did you make that too?

29:25.400 --> 29:27.160
I made all the furniture and decorations.

29:27.270 --> 29:28.310
The bedding,

29:28.400 --> 29:29.200
cups, and utensils

29:29.200 --> 29:30.240
were all brought by me

29:30.240 --> 29:31.030
from Baitou Mountain.

29:32.240 --> 29:33.030
Look.

29:33.110 --> 29:34.070
I even brought

29:34.070 --> 29:35.070
my master's chessboard here too.

29:35.070 --> 29:36.240
We can play chess now.

29:39.410 --> 29:40.720
Let's go check out my room.

29:49.590 --> 29:51.000
It's truly a masterpiece.

29:51.550 --> 29:52.590
This is called Linglong House.

29:52.680 --> 29:53.750
You've heard of it, right?

29:54.640 --> 29:55.440
I've heard of it,

29:55.590 --> 29:56.550
but I've never seen one.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.270
Such creation techniques

29:58.960 --> 30:00.830
could rightfully be called a divine skill, I believe.

30:02.270 --> 30:04.160
You truly live up to your reputation, Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

30:04.480 --> 30:05.310
It's alright, I guess.

30:16.480 --> 30:17.270
How are you?

30:17.510 --> 30:18.000
Are you hurt anywhere?

30:18.000 --> 30:18.680
Where's the dog?

30:18.720 --> 30:19.310
What?

30:19.830 --> 30:20.640
The dog!

30:22.270 --> 30:23.070
We need to catch it.

30:23.070 --> 30:24.590
The Liujiao Palace is still in its mouth!

30:27.830 --> 30:28.640
Madam.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.160
Why hasn't Wangcai

30:30.160 --> 30:31.030
come today?

30:31.270 --> 30:32.000
That's weird.

30:32.000 --> 30:33.110
It's already mealtime.

30:33.110 --> 30:34.400
Usually, it would have been here by now.

30:39.480 --> 30:40.270
Ji Tanyin!

30:40.750 --> 30:41.550
Slow down!

30:43.350 --> 30:44.680
Madam, look.

30:44.700 --> 30:46.250
That young lady is running so fast.

30:46.400 --> 30:47.510
Even faster than Wangcai.

30:53.830 --> 30:54.640
Good dog.

30:54.890 --> 30:56.480
Give it back to me, and I'll forgive you.

30:57.740 --> 30:59.910
Be good. Open your mouth, will you?

31:06.160 --> 31:06.880
This is the last refuge

31:06.880 --> 31:08.480
for me and him.

31:08.500 --> 31:09.940
If you don't give it back to us,

31:10.160 --> 31:10.960
we

31:11.000 --> 31:12.720
will have to sleep on the streets tonight.

31:24.000 --> 31:24.680
Go.

31:35.270 --> 31:36.070
Let's go.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.390
Let's go.

31:40.510 --> 31:41.310
Run!

32:03.310 --> 32:04.590
What are you doing?

32:06.960 --> 32:08.310
It's covered in dog saliva.

32:08.750 --> 32:09.550
I'm washing it.

32:18.950 --> 32:20.430
So you knew it would leak all along.

32:22.110 --> 32:23.590
Well, the house is open-air after all.

32:23.680 --> 32:24.790
Of course it's going to leak.

32:24.790 --> 32:25.640
Then why didn't you stop me

32:25.640 --> 32:26.680
when I was washing it?

32:26.900 --> 32:28.490
Would you have stopped if I had?

32:30.480 --> 32:31.270
Get to work.

33:16.080 --> 33:17.760
You have quite a few things in your portable cosmic bag.

33:20.070 --> 33:21.070
Just no money.

33:21.830 --> 33:22.960
You're not new to

33:22.960 --> 33:24.110
wandering in this world.

33:24.110 --> 33:25.480
Why didn't you bring any money when you went out?

33:25.590 --> 33:26.350
It was because

33:26.350 --> 33:27.680
I was out with you, okay?

33:28.240 --> 33:29.510
Why would a handmaiden

33:29.510 --> 33:30.960
bring money when going out with her master?

33:31.200 --> 33:32.000
You...

33:38.110 --> 33:39.510
Do you think we're high enough

33:40.480 --> 33:41.920
that the dogs can't climb up here?

34:16.880 --> 34:17.710
I gave up Yunniang

34:17.710 --> 34:19.000
because I'm still clear-minded.

34:22.920 --> 34:23.710
What about you?

34:24.360 --> 34:25.440
Are you clear-minded?

34:34.760 --> 34:35.550
What's wrong?

34:36.000 --> 34:37.280
Let's go find the weapon spirit.

34:38.920 --> 34:40.030
There's no need to rush.

34:40.030 --> 34:40.920
Let's go now.

34:41.030 --> 34:41.920
If we find it quickly,

34:41.920 --> 34:43.320
we can meet up with Zi Fei and the others.

34:43.320 --> 34:44.550
Then we'll have money.

34:48.630 --> 34:49.480
Let's go.

34:49.760 --> 34:50.400
Come on, hurry up.

34:50.400 --> 34:52.030
I told you there's no need to rush.

34:53.480 --> 34:54.150
Why don't we

34:54.150 --> 34:55.360
disguise ourselves?

34:55.360 --> 34:56.960
It wouldn't be good if someone recognizes us.

34:57.360 --> 34:58.150
No need.

34:59.110 --> 35:01.190
The human race has another characteristic.

35:01.840 --> 35:02.710
They're forgetful.

35:03.320 --> 35:04.110
Is that so?

35:05.760 --> 35:06.550
Let's go.

35:31.190 --> 35:32.030
Aren't you going to eat?

35:32.670 --> 35:33.480
No.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.630
You're full after just one pancake?

35:36.230 --> 35:37.630
No, I'm still hungry.

35:37.630 --> 35:38.480
Then why aren't you eating?

35:38.630 --> 35:39.630
You don't have any money.

35:48.150 --> 35:48.920
This jade pendant should be

35:48.920 --> 35:50.070
worth quite a lot, right?

35:50.510 --> 35:51.880
Why didn't you take it out earlier?

35:52.710 --> 35:53.510
I forgot.

35:56.760 --> 35:57.670
Are you going to eat or not?

36:04.710 --> 36:05.920
What are you eating?

36:06.070 --> 36:06.650
Noodles.

36:06.790 --> 36:08.470
Of course I know you're eating noodles.

36:08.710 --> 36:10.360
Why are our noodles different?

36:10.550 --> 36:12.630
Because the noodles you're eating were made by me.

36:16.070 --> 36:17.280
You made a bowl of noodles for me

36:17.280 --> 36:18.150
by yourself?

36:21.710 --> 36:22.760
Previously at Orange Lake,

36:23.110 --> 36:24.400
when you got possessed,

36:24.550 --> 36:25.360
that day

36:25.960 --> 36:27.150
should have been your birthday, right?

36:35.320 --> 36:36.110
What are you doing?

36:36.920 --> 36:38.070
Tasting yours.

36:38.400 --> 36:39.840
What if your noodles taste better than mine?

36:39.840 --> 36:40.190
I...

36:40.190 --> 36:41.840
But now that I've tried it,

36:41.840 --> 36:43.480
your cooking does taste better.

36:50.510 --> 36:51.320
Where are we going

36:51.320 --> 36:52.320
to look for Xiu later?

36:53.710 --> 36:54.880
Xiu likes lively places.

36:55.190 --> 36:56.710
Aren't you a regular in Yandu?

36:56.800 --> 36:57.710
You should know

36:57.710 --> 36:58.840
where the liveliest places are, right?

36:59.070 --> 37:00.360
There are quite a few.

37:04.400 --> 37:05.190
Ji Tanyin.

37:05.920 --> 37:06.760
Happy birthday.

37:46.510 --> 37:48.630
Yandu has two districts each in the east, west, and north,

37:48.920 --> 37:50.440
while the south alone occupies three districts.

37:50.800 --> 37:51.760
We are currently in

37:51.760 --> 37:53.110
the fifth ward of the East Central District.

37:53.550 --> 37:54.670
The street we are entering

37:54.670 --> 37:55.760
is the central axis.

37:56.190 --> 37:57.150
Go straight from here,

37:57.150 --> 37:58.480
and we'll reach the west of the city.

37:58.670 --> 38:00.280
That's where the common people live.

38:00.440 --> 38:01.510
Turning right from there

38:01.710 --> 38:03.030
leads to the three southern districts,

38:03.400 --> 38:04.880
where craftsmen gather.

38:04.880 --> 38:07.190
There are spinners, masons, carpenters,

38:07.320 --> 38:08.670
iron workers, and so on.

38:08.670 --> 38:10.670
It's a mixed crowd and very noisy.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.120
The two northern districts are where the City Lord's Mansion is located.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.590
That area has always been quiet,

38:16.630 --> 38:18.510
and parades and markets are prohibited there.

38:18.720 --> 38:20.280
Xiu probably wouldn't like it there.

38:20.590 --> 38:21.440
We are currently in

38:21.440 --> 38:23.280
the East Central and East Outer Districts.

38:23.440 --> 38:25.110
This is where trade and commerce are concentrated.

38:25.230 --> 38:26.620
There are taverns, teahouses,

38:26.860 --> 38:28.220
theaters, entertainment houses;

38:28.250 --> 38:29.250
everything you can think of.

38:29.440 --> 38:31.000
It's bustling with activity during the day

38:31.110 --> 38:33.000
and equally lively at night.

38:33.320 --> 38:34.320
If I were Xiu,

38:34.320 --> 38:35.440
I'd like it here too.

38:39.710 --> 38:40.800
Would you like to try

38:40.800 --> 38:42.230
Yandu's mode of transportation?

38:42.360 --> 38:43.150
What is it?

38:48.110 --> 38:49.080
This is a barrel cart.

38:53.960 --> 38:54.840
Isn't Yandu known as

38:54.840 --> 38:55.920
the city of craftsmanship?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.590
Why would they allow such wooden barrel carts

38:57.620 --> 38:58.750
to travel in the city?

38:59.800 --> 39:01.670
It's fun, don't you think?

39:03.400 --> 39:05.110
Actually, I didn't quite understand it before, either.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.710
Since the human race

39:06.710 --> 39:08.190
can already build tower ships,

39:08.190 --> 39:08.880
why would they

39:08.880 --> 39:10.070
go back to basics

39:10.070 --> 39:12.070
and use barrel carts as a means of transportation?

39:12.510 --> 39:13.630
But today, I suddenly realized

39:13.630 --> 39:14.590
one of its advantages,

39:14.590 --> 39:16.630
and it all made sense.

39:18.030 --> 39:19.880
Because it doesn't cost any money.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.880
That's indeed a huge advantage.

39:23.900 --> 39:25.550
Moreover, tower ships need

39:25.550 --> 39:26.440
the crystals of the Youhu Clan

39:26.440 --> 39:27.400
as their power source.

39:27.400 --> 39:28.840
But barrel carts don't need that.

39:29.070 --> 39:29.760
They only need

39:29.760 --> 39:31.670
to navigate Yandu City's terrain

39:31.670 --> 39:32.320
to move autonomously

39:32.320 --> 39:33.550
on the roads.

39:33.840 --> 39:34.840
Isn't that the meaning

39:34.840 --> 39:36.000
of the art of craftsmanship?

39:36.280 --> 39:37.480
Those interesting

39:37.840 --> 39:39.630
and imaginative ideas

39:39.840 --> 39:40.510
are actually

39:40.510 --> 39:42.190
just icing on the cake.

39:44.480 --> 39:45.800
What do you think?

39:46.110 --> 39:46.920
Do you think that

39:47.230 --> 39:49.110
one day, due to the development of craftsmen,

39:49.440 --> 39:51.630
barrel carts will be replaced by tower ships?

39:52.150 --> 39:53.280
Will there be a day

39:53.400 --> 39:55.280
when they suddenly disappear completely?

40:00.150 --> 40:02.230
What does any of this have to do with me?

40:03.800 --> 40:04.670
Won't you

40:04.670 --> 40:06.280
suddenly miss it one day?

40:06.840 --> 40:08.880
It's like how we never remember

40:08.880 --> 40:10.360
the delicacies we normally eat,

40:10.360 --> 40:12.110
but you'll definitely remember

40:12.110 --> 40:13.550
that bowl of plain noodles we ate

40:13.550 --> 40:14.630
when we were wanted in the entire city

40:14.630 --> 40:16.230
and penniless.

40:20.480 --> 40:21.360
We can continue

40:21.860 --> 40:23.450
to eat plain noodles tonight.

40:26.400 --> 40:27.360
Tomorrow's three meals

40:27.560 --> 40:29.000
can also all be plain noodles.

40:32.300 --> 40:33.190
You're not telling me that

40:33.190 --> 40:34.840
before Zi Fei arrives in Yandu,

40:35.010 --> 40:36.070
all we can afford

40:36.070 --> 40:37.070
is plain noodles, are you?

40:37.280 --> 40:38.070
That's right.

40:45.330 --> 40:46.120
Come on.

40:50.880 --> 40:51.360
Here.

40:52.920 --> 40:53.710
Look.

40:54.400 --> 40:55.320
What is this place?

40:56.280 --> 40:57.360
This is where craftsmen rest

40:57.360 --> 40:58.510
and drink tea.

40:59.080 --> 41:00.330
Why is a place for rest and entertainment

41:00.360 --> 41:01.800
so noisy?

41:02.880 --> 41:03.800
Usually, when craftsmen

41:03.800 --> 41:04.670
work together,

41:04.670 --> 41:05.440
there are always times

41:05.440 --> 41:06.630
when they disagree.

41:06.760 --> 41:08.150
If they argue until their mouths are dry,

41:08.150 --> 41:09.480
they'll come here for a cup of tea.

41:09.510 --> 41:10.800
But usually, they

41:10.800 --> 41:12.070
continue to argue for a while longer.

41:13.030 --> 41:13.840
Didn't you say Xiu

41:13.840 --> 41:15.320
likes lively places?

41:15.320 --> 41:16.630
This place is lively enough, isn't it?

41:17.000 --> 41:18.550
What Xiu likes is liveliness,

41:18.550 --> 41:19.880
not noise.

41:26.070 --> 41:27.590
During my 60 years of seclusion,

41:27.880 --> 41:28.960
the outside world

41:29.320 --> 41:30.550
has undergone tremendous changes

41:30.550 --> 41:32.430
due to the human race's craftsmanship.

41:32.800 --> 41:33.880
Yet behind closed doors,

41:34.150 --> 41:35.190
they are still passionate about

41:35.190 --> 41:36.360
arguing and debating.

41:37.190 --> 41:38.360
It seems so.

41:39.280 --> 41:40.440
Humans always like

41:40.440 --> 41:42.150
to distinguish right from wrong,

41:42.720 --> 41:43.880
even though they know

41:44.070 --> 41:45.030
that many things

41:45.050 --> 41:46.610
don't have clear boundaries.

41:47.400 --> 41:48.590
But they still keep

41:48.590 --> 41:49.920
defining these boundaries

41:49.920 --> 41:51.550
and using them to constrain themselves.

41:53.400 --> 41:55.230
Although humans live no more than 100 years,

41:55.550 --> 41:56.880
sometimes their vision

41:57.110 --> 41:59.000
is more far-reaching

41:59.110 --> 42:00.070
than that of the Youhu Clan and the War Demon Clan.

42:01.190 --> 42:02.230
I thought you wouldn't like

42:02.230 --> 42:03.190
these constraints.

42:06.050 --> 42:06.660
Oh, right.

42:06.780 --> 42:08.260
I'll take you to another place.

42:08.400 --> 42:09.510
It's lively there too.

42:09.510 --> 42:10.190
Maybe Xiu

42:10.190 --> 42:11.510
likes to hang out there.

42:11.710 --> 42:13.550
Alright, for the next place,

42:13.570 --> 42:14.820
I'll lead the way.

42:18.290 --> 42:19.400
[Dance House]

42:34.590 --> 42:36.400
Is this the place you were talking about?

42:38.960 --> 42:40.230
You two have come at just the right time.

42:40.440 --> 42:41.320
The Immortal Dance

42:41.320 --> 42:42.590
is just about to begin.

42:42.670 --> 42:43.880
There are still some good seats available.

42:43.880 --> 42:45.280
Let me show you to your seats.

42:48.880 --> 42:49.760
Thank you, esteemed guests.

42:51.760 --> 42:53.480
You two aren't from Yandu, are you?

42:53.670 --> 42:54.800
Don't blink in a moment.

42:54.960 --> 42:55.960
This Flying Immortal Dance

42:55.960 --> 42:57.450
is one of a kind in Yandu.

42:58.480 --> 42:59.710
A number of scholars and refined guests

42:59.710 --> 43:01.280
have come here to witness its splendor.

43:01.300 --> 43:02.570
What makes it one of a kind?
